          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import chi2\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2026)\nn = 400\n# Fitur right-skewed + heteroskedastisitas kuat: std(eps | x) tumbuh cepat bersama x\nx = np.exp(rng.normal(0.5, 0.55, size=n))\nsigma_i = 0.3 + 0.9 * (x ** 1.2)\ny = 4.0 + 2.5 * x + rng.normal(0.0, sigma_i)\n\nX = np.column_stack([np.ones(n), x])\np = X.shape[1]\nols = LinearRegression(fit_intercept=False).fit(X, y)\nbeta_ols = ols.coef_\ne = y - X @ beta_ols\n\n# 1. Uji Heteroskedastisitas Breusch-Pagan: regresi e^2 terhadap x\ne2 = e ** 2\nr2_bp = LinearRegression().fit(x[:, None], e2).score(x[:, None], e2)\nlm_bp = n * r2_bp\np_bp = float(chi2.sf(lm_bp, df=1))\n\n# 2. Uji White: regresi e^2 terhadap [x, x^2]\nX_white = np.column_stack([x, x ** 2])\nr2_white = LinearRegression().fit(X_white, e2).score(X_white, e2)\nlm_white = n * r2_white\np_white = float(chi2.sf(lm_white, df=2))\n\n# 3. Standard Error Klasik OLS vs HC3 Sandwich Robust SE vs Feasible WLS\nXtX_inv = np.linalg.inv(X.T @ X)\ns2 = float(np.sum(e2) / (n - p))\nse_ols_naive = np.sqrt(np.diag(s2 * XtX_inv))\n\nQ, _ = np.linalg.qr(X, mode=\"reduced\")\nh = np.sum(Q ** 2, axis=1)\nmeat_hc3 = X.T @ ((e2 / ((1.0 - h) ** 2))[:, None] * X)\nse_hc3 = np.sqrt(np.diag(XtX_inv @ meat_hc3 @ XtX_inv))\n\n# 4. Feasible WLS memakai bobot 1 / sigma_hat_i^2\nstd_model = LinearRegression().fit(x[:, None], np.abs(e))\nsigma_hat = np.maximum(std_model.predict(x[:, None]), 0.2)\nw_wls = 1.0 / (sigma_hat ** 2)\nwls = LinearRegression(fit_intercept=False).fit(X, y, sample_weight=w_wls)\nbeta_wls = wls.coef_\ne_wls = y - X @ beta_wls\ns2_wls = float(np.sum(w_wls * (e_wls ** 2)) / (n - p))\nse_wls = np.sqrt(np.diag(s2_wls * np.linalg.inv(X.T @ (w_wls[:, None] * X))))\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Heteroskedastisitas: Breusch-Pagan, White, HC3 & Feasible WLS ===\")\nprint(f\"Breusch-Pagan LM = {lm_bp:6.2f} (p-value = {p_bp:.2e}) -> Heteroskedastik!\")\nprint(f\"White Test    LM = {lm_white:6.2f} (p-value = {p_white:.2e}) -> Heteroskedastik!\")\nprint(f\"Slope Sejati     = 2.5000\")\nprint(f\"OLS Klasik       : beta1 = {beta_ols[1]:.4f} | Naive SE = {se_ols_naive[1]:.4f} (underestimate {se_hc3[1]/se_ols_naive[1]:.2f}x!)\")\nprint(f\"OLS + HC3 Robust : beta1 = {beta_ols[1]:.4f} | HC3   SE = {se_hc3[1]:.4f} (terkalibrasi)\")\nprint(f\"Feasible WLS     : beta1 = {beta_wls[1]:.4f} | WLS   SE = {se_wls[1]:.4f} (efisiensi tertinggi)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Heteroskedastisitas: Breusch-Pagan, White, HC3 & Feasible WLS ===\nBreusch-Pagan LM =  38.98 (p-value = 4.27e-10) -> Heteroskedastik!\nWhite Test    LM =  40.87 (p-value = 1.33e-09) -> Heteroskedastik!\nSlope Sejati     = 2.5000\nOLS Klasik       : beta1 = 2.6319 | Naive SE = 0.1128 (underestimate 2.24x!)\nOLS + HC3 Robust : beta1 = 2.6319 | HC3   SE = 0.2525 (terkalibrasi)\nFeasible WLS     : beta1 = 2.5511 | WLS   SE = 0.1220 (efisiensi tertinggi)",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Heteroskedastisitas: Breusch-Pagan, White, HC3 & Feasible WLS ===\nBreusch-Pagan LM =  38.98 (p-value = 4.27e-10) -> Heteroskedastik!\nWhite Test    LM =  40.87 (p-value = 1.33e-09) -> Heteroskedastik!\nSlope Sejati     = 2.5000\nOLS Klasik       : beta1 = 2.6319 | Naive SE = 0.1128 (underestimate 2.24x!)\nOLS + HC3 Robust : beta1 = 2.6319 | HC3   SE = 0.2525 (terkalibrasi)\nFeasible WLS     : beta1 = 2.5511 | WLS   SE = 0.1220 (efisiensi tertinggi)",
