          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingRegressor\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import QuantileRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import mean_pinball_loss\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(77)\nn = 750\njarak = rng.uniform(1.0, 16.0, size=n)\nsibuk = rng.binomial(1, 0.45, size=n).astype(float)\nhujan = rng.uniform(0.0, 1.0, size=n)\nantrean_resto = rng.uniform(0.0, 20.0, size=n)\n\n# Interaksi non-linear kuat (bottleneck kemacetan saat sibuk & hujan di jarak jauh)\nbottleneck = 18.0 * ((jarak > 8.0) & (sibuk == 1.0)).astype(float) * (0.4 + hujan)\nmean_part = 7.0 + 2.0 * jarak + 0.5 * antrean_resto + bottleneck\nnoise_scale = 0.6 + 0.25 * jarak + 5.5 * (sibuk * (hujan > 0.5))\neta = mean_part + rng.gamma(shape=2.0, scale=noise_scale, size=n)\n\nX = np.column_stack([jarak, sibuk, hujan, antrean_resto])\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, eta, test_size=0.30, random_state=42)\n\ndef evaluate_quantiles(name, q10, q50, q90):\n    pl50 = mean_pinball_loss(y_te, q50, alpha=0.50)\n    pl90 = mean_pinball_loss(y_te, q90, alpha=0.90)\n    cov80 = float(np.mean((y_te >= q10) & (y_te <= q90)))\n    cov90 = float(np.mean(y_te <= q90))\n    width = float(np.mean(q90 - q10))\n    alpha = 0.20\n    winkler = float(np.mean(\n        (q90 - q10)\n        + (2.0 / alpha) * np.maximum(q10 - y_te, 0.0)\n        + (2.0 / alpha) * np.maximum(y_te - q90, 0.0)\n    ))\n    print(f\"{name:<24s} | P50={pl50:.2f} | P90={pl90:.2f} | P90Cov={cov90*100:4.1f}% | 80%Cov={cov80*100:4.1f}% | Width={width:5.1f}m | Winkler={winkler:5.2f}\")\n\n# 1. Linear QuantileRegressor (HiGHS LP)\nqr_preds = {\n    tau: QuantileRegressor(quantile=tau, alpha=0.0, solver=\"highs\").fit(X_tr, y_tr).predict(X_te)\n    for tau in (0.10, 0.50, 0.90)\n}\n\n# 2. Non-Linear HistGradientBoostingRegressor (min_samples_leaf=30 agar ekor P90 tidak overfit!)\nhgb_preds = {\n    tau: HistGradientBoostingRegressor(\n        loss=\"quantile\", quantile=tau, max_iter=65, max_depth=4,\n        min_samples_leaf=30, l2_regularization=1.0, learning_rate=0.06, random_state=42\n    ).fit(X_tr, y_tr).predict(X_te)\n    for tau in (0.10, 0.50, 0.90)\n}\n\nprint(\"=== Perbandingan QuantileRegressor (Linear LP) vs HistGradientBoosting (Non-Linear) ===\")\nevaluate_quantiles(\"QuantileRegressor (LP)\", qr_preds[0.10], qr_preds[0.50], qr_preds[0.90])\nevaluate_quantiles(\"HistGradientBoosting\", hgb_preds[0.10], hgb_preds[0.50], hgb_preds[0.90])",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Perbandingan QuantileRegressor (Linear LP) vs HistGradientBoosting (Non-Linear) ===\nQuantileRegressor (LP)   | P50=3.91 | P90=2.27 | P90Cov=86.2% | 80%Cov=72.9% | Width= 21.0m | Winkler=35.10\nHistGradientBoosting     | P50=2.88 | P90=1.65 | P90Cov=86.7% | 80%Cov=70.7% | Width= 19.4m | Winkler=29.99",
          "actualOutput": "=== Perbandingan QuantileRegressor (Linear LP) vs HistGradientBoosting (Non-Linear) ===\nQuantileRegressor (LP)   | P50=3.91 | P90=2.27 | P90Cov=86.2% | 80%Cov=72.9% | Width= 21.0m | Winkler=35.10\nHistGradientBoosting     | P50=2.88 | P90=1.65 | P90Cov=86.7% | 80%Cov=70.7% | Width= 19.4m | Winkler=29.99",
          "explanation": "Membandingkan Linear QuantileRegressor terhadap HistGradientBoostingRegressor(loss='quantile') pada interaksi non-linear kemacetan menggunakan Pinball Loss, 80% Coverage, lebar interval, dan Winkler Score.",
